{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if... Victor Frankenstein had competition? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/dd88403752c8bb8c5a5d1f0316a31cc0.avif?t=1769236454\" width=1508 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK ALONGSIDE A MONSTER </strong>from your collection, raiding across a large map to<strong>\u00a0GET THE PARTS YOU NEED FOR YOUR NEW MONSTER CREATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.poster.avif?t=1769236454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.webm?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/ea6f16b1396b67791efbe6b31cf09025.mp4?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Due to your hippocratic oath, any part you steal must have one left in its place, so<strong>\u00a0SWAP STRATEGICALLY</strong>\u00a0- Don't accidentally leave a rival scientist a part they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.poster.avif?t=1769236454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.webm?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/e35f4233add1ca31026ee0d45973f1de.mp4?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time's up, the<strong>\u00a0SCIENTIFIC SOCIETY WILL JUDGE YOUR NEW CREATION</strong>. Do better than your rivals to win - boosting your reputation and unlocking new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.poster.avif?t=1769236454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.webm?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/5b722b41f976aa83a756b15770ead619.mp4?t=1769236454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Shelley's creature (from novel) is one of 13 voiced monsters you can <strong>BUILD AND COLLECT, </strong>each\u00a0referencing a different monster from the 200 years of\u00a0mad Frankenstein science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0- SINGLEPLAYER &amp; MULTIPLAYER -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the full game solo offline - against bot scientists, conquering 10 evolving contests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go multiplayer - a raucous 2D friendslop with voicechat and competitive banter, full of monster assaults, backstabbing raids, and excusing ridiculous creature-builds in front of a sceptical scientific audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>To support our tiny-team, catch the discount on launch, and get updates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PLAYTEST COMING SOON...</stron